      <title>Android 17收紧内存限制：应用吃太多内存将被系统杀掉</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260821/Android-17%E6%94%B6%E7%B4%A7%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E5%90%83%E5%A4%AA%E5%A4%9A%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E5%B0%86%E8%A2%AB%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E6%9D%80%E6%8E%89/</link>
